120469/first-nations-historic-meeting-carney-premiers/","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Business","title":"Oil drops over 6% as Iran diplomacy appears to gain momentum","summary":"Brent fell from about $117 at Friday's close to around $110 on Monday morning, and WTI slipped about 2% to $101.5, as mediators headed to Tehran. S&P 500 futures were up 0.3%.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/oil-plunges-more-than-6-from-near-wartime-highs-as-diplomacy-over-iran-seemingly-gathers","published":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"n5","cat":"World","title":"Zelenskyy says Ukraine-US-Russia talks will take place in November","summary":"Putin reportedly agreed in principle to resume talks after Nov. 10, focused on post-war security arrangements. Earlier rounds in Abu Dhabi and Geneva produced little beyond prisoner swaps.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/25/ukraines-zelenskyy-confirms-trilateral-talks-with-russia-and-us-to-take-place-in-november","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n6","cat":"Canada","title":"GTA and Hamilton voters elect mayors and councils today","summary":"Polls are open until 8 p.m. in Ontario municipal elections. Key races include Toronto (Olivia Chow vs. Brad Bradford), Mississauga (Carolyn Parrish vs. Bonnie Crombie) and Brampton, where Patrick Brown seeks a third term.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12110951/toronto-ontario-elections-2026/","published":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"n7","cat":"Business","title":"Microsoft, Alphabet and Amazon earnings to test AI spending this week","summary":"Microsoft and Alphabet report after the close Oct. 28 and Amazon on Oct. 29, the same week as a Fed decision. Hyperscaler capex is running near $800B a year after Meta posted negative free cash flow.","source":"Mitrade","url":"https://www.mitrade.com/insights/shares-analysis/us-stocks/big-tech-ai-capex-free-cash-flow-test-20261026J1332","published":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"n8","cat":"AI","title":"Elvis Presley rightsholders sue Anthropic over AI training","summary":"An Authentic Brands Group subsidiary alleges Anthropic used 274 Presley songs to train Claude without permission and may seek more than $40 million. Anthropic says it will fight the claims.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/why-are-elvis-presley-rightsholders-suing-ai-company-anthropic","published":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Canada","title":"Doerkson says B.C. 'chose change' as Conservatives win 64 seats","summary":"The BC Conservatives took 64 seats with 48% of the vote to the NDP's 27. Premier-designate Lorne Doerkson promises an independent review of provincial finances on day one.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12120641/bc-premier-lorne-doerkson-first-remarks/","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n10","cat":"Major","title":"Brewers rally past Rays 5-4 to take 2-0 World Series lead","summary":"Milwaukee erased a 4-0 first-inning deficit, with Sal Frelick's sixth-inning homer tying it. The series shifts to Tampa Bay for Game 3 on Monday night.","source":"MLB.com","url":"https://www.mlb.com/news/key-takeaways-from-world-series-game-2-2026","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n11","cat":"AI","title":"SpaceX closes $40B debt deal to buy Nvidia GPUs","summary":"Deliveries are due in the first half of 2027. SpaceX's quarterly revenue rose 161% to $14.58B, and Musk warned more than 200 smaller AI cloud firms could fail or merge.","source":"TipRanks","url":"https://www.tipranks.com/news/spacex-closes-40b-gpu-deal-as-musk-warns-ai-firms-could-fail","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n12","cat":"World","title":"Mar\u00eda Corina Machado returns to Venezuela after 10 months abroad","summary":"The opposition leader and Nobel laureate left in December 2025 to accept her prize; her party says she was blocked from returning seven times. The U.S. credited reconciliation talks.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/25/maria-corina-machado-back-in-venezuela-after-nearly-10-months-in-exile","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n13","cat":"Business","title":"SoftBank plans $50B AI and data-centre investment in Malaysia","summary":"Malaysian PM Anwar Ibrahim said Masayoshi Son identified sites in Kuching, Sarawak, and peninsular Malaysia. No timetable or final commitments have been disclosed.","source":"GuruFocus","url":"https://www.gurufocus.com/news/9141901/softbank-to-invest-50-billion-in-malaysias-ai-and-tech-sector","published":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"n14","cat":"AI","title":"Apollo economist: AI has shown 'zero financial payoff' outside Big Tech","summary":"Torsten Slok found flat profit margins and revenue per worker across the S&P 500 excluding seven tech giants, with no sign of AI productivity gains.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/25/ai-delivers-zero-financial-payoff-to-most-companies-according-to-apollo-economist/","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n15","cat":"Canada","title":"Canada receives first two F-35 jets as full order stays under review","summary":"The RCAF took delivery of its first two F-35s while Ottawa's planned 88-jet order remains paused, possibly for a mixed fleet with Saab Gripens.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12120725/canada-us-f35-jets-full-order-review/","published":"2026-10-25"},{"id":"n16","cat":"Major","title":"ESA weighs \u20ac10B plan for Europe to launch its own astronauts","summary":"ESA's chief proposed about \u20ac10B over ten years for a European crewed spaceflight system; member states will weigh it at a Rome ministerial meeting on Dec. 15.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/26/europe-weighs-10bn-plan-to-launch-its-own-astronauts-ahead-of-rome-space-summit","published":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"Grok releases first seven minutes of AI-generated 'Odyssey'","summary":"xAI posted 'Episode 1' about three months after Musk promised a full-length version; early reviews panne